    {
        "text": "Soldier, miner. Killer, victim. The vast Lake Angara accepts all and delivers all."
    },
    {
        "text": "Beneath the ice, an ancient nomadic city rises as the terrain changes, emerging through the sheet into the light of day."
    },
    {
        "text": "The old-style buildings and the writhing faces of the dead look the same as they did when the city sank."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
